abstract: "StaphScope is a species-optimized computational pipeline for rapid and accessible Staphylococcus aureus genotyping and surveillance. It integrates MLST, spa typing, SCCmec typing, agr typing, AMR gene detection, virulence screening, and plasmid replicon detection into a unified gene-centric and sample-centric reporting system. The pipeline is designed to be user-friendly, HPC-compatible, and Docker-ready, making it ideal for researchers and clinicians in low-resource settings."
